Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyRoadRollingBall" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :fog1 ;
    :hasEvidence :indicator1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:fog1 a :FoggyCondition .

:indicator1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 ;
    :description "A ball rolling into the road in low visibility conditions." .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Rolling ball indicates high likelihood of child or pedestrian chasing it into vehicle path." ;
    :confidenceScore "0.92"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: LaneIntrusionRisk: The presence of a rolling ball suggests a sudden intrusion into the lane by a child or pedestrian who may follow the ball, creating a significant hazard in poor visibility.
Severity Score: 0.85